<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="reference_agm_qdq_cqb">
    <title>AT+MHTTPTERM 终止HTTP传输</title>
    <shortdesc>该命令用于终止当前HTTP传输。</shortdesc>
    <refbody>
        <table id="table_q11_4rv_jqb">
            <tgroup cols="2">
                <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="3*" align="left"/>
                <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="7*" align="left"/>
                <thead>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><cmdname>AT+MHTTPTERM</cmdname></entry>
                    </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry>语法</entry>
                        <entry>响应</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>测试命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+MHTTPTERM=?</cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功<msgblock id="msgblock_fjd_kf5_pqb">+MHTTPTERM: (list of supported &lt;httpid>s)
OK</msgblock>
                            错误<msgblock id="msgblock_rmg_kf5_pqb">+CME ERROR: &lt;err></msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>执行命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+MHTTPTERM</cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功<msgblock id="msgblock_e52_lf5_pqb">OK</msgblock>
                            错误<msgblock id="msgblock_k2j_lf5_pqb">+CME ERROR: &lt;err></msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>设置命令<codeblock><cmdname>AT+MHTTPTERM=&lt;httpid></cmdname></codeblock></entry>
                        <entry>成功<msgblock id="msgblock_q2z_lf5_pqb">OK</msgblock>
                            错误<msgblock id="msgblock_gyb_mf5_pqb">+CME ERROR: &lt;err></msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">命令描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                            >该命令为中断当前请求，保留实例，执行命令终止所有连接。该命令不主动清空客户端实例中设置的特定报头和content数据（请求成功结束时自动清空），下次请求如需修改特定报头和content数据，请先使用相关命令手动清空。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">参数描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                    ><varname>&lt;httpid></varname>客户端实例id，0~3。<fn>MN319/MN319-A/MN316A/MN326A：<varname>&lt;httpid></varname>参数范围0~1。</fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">示例</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">终止当前传输
                            <msgblock id="codeblock_xy3_pwj_1rb"><cmdname>AT+MHTTPTERM=0</cmdname>
OK</msgblock></entry>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
        <section id="section_itc_vyt_rrb">
            <note id="note_x5j_vyt_rrb"
                >ML307B由于HTTP数据接收与AT命令处理为异步机制，执行本命令终止传输后，模组已接收但尚未处理完毕的数据仍会继续解析并上报URC(如+MHTTPURC或+MHTTPDLFILE)，直至在途数据处理完成后才完全停止。该部分URC不代表新请求的数据，属正常现象。</note>
        </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>
